# MVP Identity Model

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-mvp-identity-model.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-mvp-identity-model.md)

## Locked: A

Living Care Record subject = **care recipient** only.  
Caregiver = contributor / observer / attribution — not the center.

Not MVP: household records, family workspace, caregiver social network.

Store caregiver identity from day one for “who said / decided / confirmed.” Story belongs to the person receiving care.

One person → one Care Reality → one Living Care Record.
